Order Placement Saga (Choreography):

1. OrderService: create order → publish OrderCreated event
2. InventoryService: consume OrderCreated → reserve stock → publish StockReserved
3. PaymentService: consume StockReserved → charge card → publish PaymentProcessed
4. ShippingService: consume PaymentProcessed → schedule delivery → publish OrderFulfilled

Failure case — payment declined:
1-3: same as above
3'. PaymentService: charge fails → publish PaymentFailed
4'. InventoryService: consume PaymentFailed → release reserved stock → publish StockReleased
5'. OrderService: consume StockReleased → cancel order → notify customer

Orchestration alternative:
  OrderSagaOrchestrator:
    step 1: send ReserveStock command to InventoryService
    step 2: on StockReserved → send ChargePayment command to PaymentService
    step 3: on PaymentProcessed → send CreateShipment command to ShippingService
    on PaymentFailed: send ReleaseStock compensation command to InventoryService
                      send CancelOrder compensation command to OrderService
